cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "UK Public Library Policy Archive"
message: "If you use this archive or its diplomatic Markdown editions in research or policy work, please cite both the original source document and this repository using the metadata below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Libraries Hacked"
    website: "https://www.librarieshacked.org"
repository-code: "https://github.com/LibrariesHacked/uk-public-library-policy-archive"
url: "https://github.com/LibrariesHacked/uk-public-library-policy-archive"
abstract: >-
  A digital preservation and documentary source archive for UK public library
  policy, strategy, standards, consultation, and review documents published
  from approximately 1995 onwards across England, Scotland, Wales, and
  Northern Ireland. Preserves authoritative source PDFs alongside diplomatic,
  page-anchored Markdown editions, bibliographic metadata, and PREMIS-aligned
  provenance records.
keywords:
  - public libraries
  - cultural policy
  - United Kingdom
  - digital preservation
  - archival editions
  - open government
license: OGL-UK-3.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-11-01"
